  "bodyHash": "be5a2cb042d57fad",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#0cf\">快速畫作</span><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"補充包 Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"補充包 Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"補充包 YouTube\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">不僅僅是一個效能模組。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">功能：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無畫作渲染延遲</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無畫作刻延遲</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可自訂畫作模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">粒子效果</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">環境光遮蔽</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支撐方塊被破壞時反應更即時</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">遠距離時畫作不會消失</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">畫作外觀更佳，因為會使用 mipmapping 技術</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不再會因 kill 指令誤殺畫作</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">換句話說，Fast Paintings 是一個效能模組，透過最佳化畫作的渲染速度來大幅提升效能</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br>為此，該模組會將其替換為對應的方塊形式。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">方塊畫作將使用預烘焙模型（baked models）而非實體渲染器，使其達到最快的運算速度</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">此外，現在它們只是普通方塊，因此與畫作實體刻更新相關的延遲也一併消除了！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這種方式還讓畫作在支撐方塊被破壞時能立即更新，並支援粒子效果</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，它同時也是一個美化模組，因為你可以透過資源包覆蓋其 JSON 模型來完全自訂畫作外觀。你可以進行複雜的修改，例如在周圍加上木製邊框。非常華麗！<br>要這樣做，只需編輯模型，在每個部分包含一個 JSON 或參考模型即可（例如，「top_left」是用於應用到左上角的模型）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>別擔心，你仍然可以穿過它們。秘密門耶！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在尋找使用本模組自訂畫作模型功能的材質包？不用找了！<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/framed-paintings-fast-paintings-custom-model\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/955/46/638446800683802696.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><br></span></span></p>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">開發模組佔用了我很多的時間，如果你喜歡我的作品並想支持我，可以在這裡進行。支持後，你會獲得專屬於你的客製化地球儀或雕像！即使你是使用優惠碼 \"supplementaries\" 在 Akliz 購買伺服器，也能享有此福利。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？來看看 Akliz，他們提供專為模組版 Minecraft 打造的高品質伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有非常溫馨的社群、卓越的客服支援，伺服器表現也非常出色</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用優惠碼 \"supplementaries\" 可享 8 折優惠，同時也能支持到我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmehvahdjukaar.github.io%252fMcPerformanceMods%252f%2523setup\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZxxbOvz.png\" alt=\"不建議使用 Optifine\" width=\"1000\" height=\"178\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpMHfZ5.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"靈異豐收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之靈\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"儲存標籤\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"頂級模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神話橡木樹\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯階梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"效果說明\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡蓮葉\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"進度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"隨機礦\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
